Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:01:55.30,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单1/4决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:55.30,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}佩古拉 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 纳瓦罗 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.30,EN,,0,0,0,,First of all, Arthur Ashe Stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 阿瑟·阿什球场的观众们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:02.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's give it up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我们把掌声送给
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,for an epic three-setter by Jess Pegula
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,奉献精彩三盘大战的佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:12.79,EN,,0,0,0,,and Emma Navarro Hearing that crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:12.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,和纳瓦罗 听到现场观众
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.61,EN,,0,0,0,,and them cheering for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样为你欢呼加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:16.43,EN,,0,0,0,,What does that mean Jess?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:16.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰西 这对你意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:18.07,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it means everything today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:18.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天 这对我来说就是一切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:20.05,EN,,0,0,0,,It was really tough It was physical.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛很艰难 体能消耗很大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:22.65,EN,,0,0,0,,It's humid We weren't I wasn't exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:22.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,天气闷热 我们 我今天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:24.97,EN,,0,0,0,,serving my best and I was fighting a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:24.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球并不在最佳状态 还要对抗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:26.23,EN,,0,0,0,,of demons out there today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:26.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,场上冒出的许多负面念头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:27.63,EN,,0,0,0,,So thank you guys so much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:27.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 真的非常感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:29.31,EN,,0,0,0,,for coming out here and it's an honor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:29.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,来到这里 能在你们面前打球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.31,0:00:33.55,EN,,0,0,0,,to play in front of you guys Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.31,0:00:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我的荣幸 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.22,EN,,0,0,0,,there's there's nothing like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的 没有任何感觉能比得上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:38.56,EN,,0,0,0,,It's it's amazing every single time Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一次都这么棒 那么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:39.98,EN,,0,0,0,,when I think of your game I think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:39.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,说起你的比赛 我会想到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:42.58,EN,,0,0,0,,about perseverance and what it's taken you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,是坚持 是你一路走来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.58,0:00:44.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to get to this point Can you share
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.58,0:00:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,付出的努力 能不能分享一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:48.42,EN,,0,0,0,,with the crowd what it has taken for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:48.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,走到今天 你付出了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:49.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:51.62,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's just a lot of self -belief I think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得要非常相信自己 我想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:54.90,EN,,0,0,0,,that I just really enjoy playing this game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:54.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很享受这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and challenging myself every single day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,也享受每天挑战自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.10,EN,,0,0,0,,to get better I think I I do a great job
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,让自己进步 我觉得我很擅长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of having a short -term memory So I know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,不纠结刚发生的事 所以我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:02.76,EN,,0,0,0,,that every time I come out no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一次上场 无论发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:06.22,EN,,0,0,0,,I just have to Tell all the the negative me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都得让那个消极的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:08.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to shut up and just play tennis and compete
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 继续打球 继续竞争
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:10.54,EN,,0,0,0,,and battle and think out there and try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,去拼 去思考 尽可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:13.06,EN,,0,0,0,,and problem solve as best I can and Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,找到解决办法 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:15.26,EN,,0,0,0,,that's that's all I'm trying to do really well
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真正想做的就是这些
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and last thing I won't let you go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后 先别急着走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.82,EN,,0,0,0,,without having those conversations with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,还得聊聊你和教练团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:20.48,EN,,0,0,0,,your coaching team I know they've left now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些对话 他们现在已经走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,so they can't defend themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以没机会替自己辩解了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:23.94,EN,,0,0,0,,What was that back -and -forth like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:23.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们这样来回交流
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:25.46,EN,,0,0,0,,for you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,当时是什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:28.76,EN,,0,0,0,,That's okay. I mean The coach's box
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:28.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,没关系 其实教练席就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:30.56,EN,,0,0,0,,is like sometimes you're fighting with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候你会跟他们较劲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:32.16,EN,,0,0,0,,but you're also it's like in a good way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这种较劲也有积极的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:33.40,EN,,0,0,0,,you know It's trying to get you going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:33.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们想让你振作起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:34.38,EN,,0,0,0,,It's trying to get energy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,想让你找到能量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:35.84,EN,,0,0,0,,At the same time you're trying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,同时你也得努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:37.94,EN,,0,0,0,,to listen get feedback and all this stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:37.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,听进去 获取反馈和建议
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:40.18,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I mean they've they've all played
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:40.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们都打过球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:41.40,EN,,0,0,0,,they know what it's like out there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:41.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,知道身处场上是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:42.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And so they do a great job
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:42.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.14,EN,,0,0,0,,of supporting me no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,无论如何都会支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:46.38,EN,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't mean sometimes I can get
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这不代表我有时不会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:48.54,EN,,0,0,0,,a little annoyed Well, that was fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,有点烦 看你们互动挺有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:49.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jess. Good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 杰西 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:51.72,EN,,0,0,0,,in your semi -final everyone Give it up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝半决赛顺利 大家为她鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,for Jessica Pegula into the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,佩古拉闯进了半决赛
